 "root_cause": "UTF-8 source bytes can contain YAML escapes that decode into surrogate code units. Domain document validation checked metadata lengths and shape but not UTF-8 encodability; invalid descriptions reached SQLite as UnicodeEncodeError and owner create/edit returned 500. Invalid escaped versions were accepted.",
 "changes": [
  "Validate decoded description, optional version and body UTF-8 after existing structure/character limits and before returning metadata",
  "Reject surrogate code units, including surrogate pairs represented as two Python code points, with invalid_skill/422 before install file publication or revision writes",
  "Keep actual Unicode scalars, Chinese, emoji, combining text, exact character limits and original SKILL.md/reference bytes; do not replace, drop or normalize characters",
  "Preserve parser duplicate-field policy, ZIP/package limits, async ownership, review requirements and existing revisions"
 ],
